@startuml i4-audit-components
' I4 S1 / E25 — audit + JSON logs (docs/hld/71-i4-wave4.md §71.2, D31); read side S5 / E29 (§71.6).
' One API-layer middleware and one append-only table. session_events stay the in-session record (D5).

title Audit and JSON logs — middleware, audit_log, JSON log files, admin read side

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment left
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11

actor "user\n(TRAINEE / INSTRUCTOR / ADMIN)" as user

node "backend process\nbackend/app" as backend {
  component "api/main.py\nAuditMiddleware (ASGI)\nafter the response: path template,\noperationId, status, ip, target ids;\nnever bodies; /health/* excluded;\n401/403 = ACCESS_DENIED; WS connect" as mw
  component "api/routers/*\n(every existing and I4 route)" as routers
  component "api/routers/auth.py loginUser\nLOGIN_SUCCEEDED / LOGIN_FAILED\n(explicit: unauthenticated)" as login
  component "application/ports/audit_log.py\nAuditRecorder.record(entry)\nAuditReader.page(filter)" as port
  component "infrastructure/persistence/\naudit_log_repository.py" as repo
  component "infrastructure/logging/json_formatter.py\n(stdlib; SIM_LOG_FORMAT=json|text)" as jsonfmt
  component "application/admin/* (E29)\nlistAuditLog, getUsageStats,\ngetErrorReport, listAdminAlerts" as admin
  component "Settings\nSIM_AUDIT_RETENTION_DAYS (default 365, >= 183)\nSIM_LOG_DIR" as settings
}

node "voice-agent / sip-gateway\nworkers/voice_agent" as workers {
  component "logging: json_formatter\n(replaces basicConfig)" as wjson
}

node "livekit" as lk {
  component "livekit.yaml json: true (E26)" as lkjson
}

database "postgres" as pg {
  component "audit_log (0016)\nappend-only trigger\nix (ts), (user_id, ts)" as audit
  component "session_events\n(unchanged, in-session record)" as evt
}

folder "SIM_LOG_DIR\nbackend JSON log (rotated)" as logdir

user --> mw : HTTP / WS
mw --> routers
mw --> login
mw ..> port : record(entry)
login ..> port : record(entry)
port <|.. repo
repo --> audit : INSERT only
routers --> evt : session actions (as today)
jsonfmt --> logdir
admin ..> port : page(filter)
admin ..> logdir : level >= ERROR
admin ..> evt : MODEL_ERROR,\nINFERENCE_HEALTH_CHANGED -> FATAL
settings ..> repo : retention floor

note bottom of audit
  UPDATE / DELETE rejected by trg_reject_mutation() (HLD 20 §20.9 pattern).
  No before/after values: a semantic journal is owner question Q-E15-3.
end note

@enduml
